{"title":"Meromorphic","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Meromorphic&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/c/43cae386c9a46d63f1b83393443008af7933b897.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D\\subseteq\\mathbb{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" /> be a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Connected_set\" title=\"Connected set\">connected</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Open_set\" title=\"Open set\">open set</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Complex_plane\" title=\"Complex plane\">complex plane</a>. A function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is said to be <b>meromorphic</b> if there are functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> which are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Holomorphic\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Holomorphic\">holomorphic</a> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> has <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Isolated_point&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Isolated point (page does not exist)\">isolated</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Root\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Root\"> zeros</a> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> can be written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/9/6e9fb54e10346e1fa57df505ac6a3576c95c80dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(z)=\\frac{g(z)}{h(z)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"94\" height=\"43\" /> wherever <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/a/9da0e4234620358534f9a7404dd6c015aaa2f5a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(z)\\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018034703\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 37/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 274/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1760/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.363      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.363      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2244:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018034703 and revision id 31006. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}